@startuml
title MediTrack - Architecture Overview

top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

package "Entry Points" {
  [Console Startup\nMain] as ConsoleStartup
  [Swing Startup\nGuiMain] as SwingStartup
  [Demo and Verification\nDemoDataSeeder\nTestRunner] as Tooling
}

package "Presentation Layer" {
  [Console UI\nConsoleApp + Menus] as ConsoleUi
  [Swing UI\nMediTrackFrame] as SwingUi
}

package "Application Layer" {
  [Core Services\nDoctorService\nPatientService\nAppointmentService\nBillingService\nClinicManagementService] as ServiceLayer
  [Observer Runtime\nConsoleNotificationObserver\nReminderSchedulerObserver] as NotificationRuntime
  [Analytics and AI\nAnalyticsConsoleMenu\nAIHelper] as Intelligence
}

package "Persistence and Support" {
  [PersistenceManager] as Persistence
  [AutoSaveService] as AutoSave
  [IdGenerator] as Ids
  [CSV + Serialization] as CsvAndSer
}

package "Domain and Storage" {
  [Domain Entities] as Domain
  [DataStore<T>] as DataStore
}

ConsoleStartup --> ConsoleUi : open console flow
ConsoleStartup --> ServiceLayer : wire services
ConsoleStartup --> Persistence : load + final save
ConsoleStartup --> AutoSave : start thread
ConsoleStartup --> NotificationRuntime : register observers

SwingStartup --> SwingUi : open Swing UI
SwingUi --> ServiceLayer

Tooling --> ServiceLayer : seed data + verify rules
Tooling --> Persistence : save/load checks
Tooling --> Intelligence : AI verification

ConsoleUi --> ServiceLayer : CRUD + scheduling
ConsoleUi --> Intelligence : AI assist + analytics
ConsoleUi --> Persistence : save now

ServiceLayer --> Domain : business rules
ServiceLayer --> DataStore : shared stores
ServiceLayer --> NotificationRuntime : appointment events
ServiceLayer --> Ids : business IDs

Persistence --> DataStore : snapshot + restore
Persistence --> CsvAndSer : CSV + SER files
Persistence --> Ids : reseed after load
AutoSave --> Persistence : periodic save

NotificationRuntime --> Domain : immutable snapshots
Intelligence --> ServiceLayer : doctor + slot lookup

legend right
This file is the high-level map only.

Use the companion UML files for class detail:
- UML_Domain.puml
- UML_Service_Collaboration.puml
- UML_Persistence.puml
endlegend

@enduml
